<title>USA: Deswell stake held by Nam Tai.</title>
<headline>Deswell stake held by Nam Tai.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nam Tai Electronics Inc said Wednesday it holds a 7.2 percent stake, or 330,522 common shares, in Deswell Industries Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Nam Tai said its latest transactions include the sale of 170,000 common shares between February 4 and February 14 at prices ranging from $18.625 to $20.75 per share.</p>
<p>Nam Tai said it sold part of its stake to realize some profits.</p>
</text>
